  (text "Raspberry Pi 60 kHz time-signal transmitter pHAT (WWVB / MSF / JJY60)" (at 25.4 20.32 0) (effects (font (size 1.8 1.8)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid 65572f0e-a2bf-469a-806e-10b17d1fb23b))
  (text "Parallel tank (as tested on breadboard): 5V -> R1 220R -> TANK_B; ferrite coil and C1..C5 in parallel between TANK_B and TANK_A;\nQ1 drain on TANK_A, source to GND. GPIO4 drives the gate via R2 470R, R3 100k holds Q1 off at boot." (at 25.4 130.0 0) (effects (font (size 1.8 1.8)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid b9e93159-4506-4e3f-bb40-43403bfd8363))
  (text "Tuning: C1+C2 = 11.5 nF for ~610 uH. Add C3/C4 (1206 C0G) or a leaded trimmer in C5 to trim to 60.000 kHz." (at 25.4 140.0 0) (effects (font (size 1.8 1.8)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid 18315fab-1175-439a-890e-345356e421b2))
